notes.content:
Optimization:
1. added game acceleration function;
2. reduced the blood level of enemies;
3. Optimized the game difficulty curve;
4. Chen Wu artillery effect modified:
Original effect: Recycle: +1(2) power for random weapon of the same name on the field
New effect: for every 1 weapon of the same name on the field, the power of that weapon is increased by 2(3)
5. Tuner's cost was adjusted from 20 to 0, and the supply gained per point of Sound Wave was adjusted from 10 to 7;

BUG:
1. fix the problem of Energy Cannon not displaying attack power;
2. fix the problem that Beyond the Music causes the redraw CD to be incorrect;
3. Repair the problem that the effect of the sailor's "landlord" does not take effect;

Known issue: After pausing the game at double speed, the cards can not be played, and it is necessary to resume double speed.

